<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Founder — Choose Your Entry</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
    .focusable:focus { outline: 2px solid #2563eb; outline-offset: 2px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50">
  <!-- Header -->
  <nav class="bg-white shadow-sm sticky top-0 z-50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="index.html" class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-700">Nextify</a>
      <a href="roles.html" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 focusable">Back</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Title -->
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 pt-10 pb-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-3">Continue as Founder</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-600">Pick how you want to start. We’ll tailor the journey and agents from the first step.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Four options -->
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 pb-16">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <!-- 1) I have an idea -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md p-6 flex flex-col">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-yellow-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">💡</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">I have an idea</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">You’ve got a concept. Let’s stress-test it, validate the problem, and shape a roadmap.</p>
        <a
          href="https://nextify-dashboard-100.streamlit.app/?entry=idea"
          target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          class="mt-auto focusable inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-3 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">
          Continue
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- 2) I know the industry -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md p-6 flex flex-col">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">🏭</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">I know the industry</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">You know where you want to play. We’ll surface trends, gaps, competitors, and opportunities.</p>
        <a
          href="https://nextify-dashboard-100.streamlit.app/?entry=industry"
          target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          class="mt-auto focusable inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-emerald-700 transition">
          Continue
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- 3) I want to build the next {company} -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md p-6 flex flex-col">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">🏗️</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">I want to build the next…</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Have a benchmark company in mind (e.g., Spotify)? We’ll analyze its model and adapt it to your market.</p>
        <a
          href="https://nextify-dashboard-100.streamlit.app/?entry=company&name=Spotify"
          target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          class="mt-auto focusable inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-3 rounded-full bg-purple-600 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-purple-700 transition">
          Continue
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- 4) Breakthrough product -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md p-6 flex flex-col">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">🧪</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Breakthrough product</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Start from a product scope. We’ll shape features, differentiation, feasibility, and GTM.</p>
        <a
          href="https://nextify-dashboard-100.streamlit.app/?entry=product"
          target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          class="mt-auto focusable inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-3 rounded-full bg-rose-600 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-rose-700 transition">
          Continue
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Small note -->
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-6">
      Tip: The links pass a query parameter (e.g., <code>?entry=idea</code>) that we’ll read in Streamlit to auto-configure the agent flow.
    </p>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
